abstract: >-
  An operations command center for Indian CA and tax practices: clients, cases,
  expiring client upload links, physical document custody, fees and PDFs, plus a
  Tax Desk ITR-preparation workspace built on a pure, deterministic, versioned
  AY 2026-27 income tax engine with evidence-cited provenance, validation,
  qualified-reviewer sign-off and filing-readiness gates.
